{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals","id":1200468,"title":"How do you cover up being known as a hunter by other supernaturals?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-28T09:52:45-07:00","id":1200468,"title":"How do you cover up being known as a hunter by other supernaturals?","content":"So my GM explained we hunters should try not to let others know what we are, but it's getting really hard when we have to use edges in front of them. I don't want to kill our supernatural allies or party members (mostly Cainites so far; Including my character's spouse NPC and 2 of the party). How do you cover up the fact you &quot;died&quot; and came back or cover up your edges when they inevitably find out? So far I just tell them to drop it, but they're becoming more and more nosy. <br /> <br /> I don't know all of the auras but I know changelings and vampires are distinctive. Is there a good species I could pretend to be without being given away by my aura? My character's shtick is sort of that his Toreador wife gave him lots of points in exposure and that he tends to work from the inside a lot with his knowledge and connections so avoiding the cainites just isn't an option, foiling their plans is his specialty. The only other hunter is an innocent and doesn't understand his powers outside of a gift from Jesus so he's less of a problem, but my character is more aware and out in the open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23892-damienls","name":"DamienLS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23892_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T10:27:02-07:00","id":1200472,"title":"","content":"Normally, a hunter wouldn't have this problem as either he or the monsters would be dead at the end of the night. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> First of, he could pretend to be some kind of mage. All splats have distinctive auras, but he may just be some normal human being who learned some magic. Hedge Magic that is, in game terms. With a vampire wife and a deep connection to supernaturals this is quite plausible, actually. But beware, if you claim to be some kind of wizard some cainites may become very, very interested in you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T11:28:57-07:00","id":1200499,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheVarulfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200472#post1200472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Normally, a hunter wouldn't have this problem as either he or the monsters would be dead at the end of the night. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> First of, he could pretend to be some kind of mage. All splats have distinctive auras, but he may just be some normal human being who learned some magic. Hedge Magic that is, in game terms. With a vampire wife and a deep connection to supernaturals this is quite plausible, actually. But beware, if you claim to be some kind of wizard some cainites may become very, very interested in you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see, thanks for the warning. I'm not too familiar with mage or magic in general in WoD. It's all a lot to learn. I will look into Hedge magic though for inspiration. This is not something to run around blathering, just in case I really need a cover story to hide that I'm a hunter one day.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23892-damienls","name":"DamienLS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23892_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T12:03:35-07:00","id":1200510,"title":"","content":"what edges do you have? I mean if they aren't super flashy &quot;I'm just her ghoul&quot; works.<br /> <br /> If you have Flashy stuff I&quot;m a Fairy/Space alien/Mutant... Its not like Vampires know shit about anything that's not vampires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2715,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","user":"Lian","date":". 03-28-2018, 03:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T13:02:15-07:00","id":1200533,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200510#post1200510\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what edges do you have? I mean if they aren't super flashy &quot;I'm just her ghoul&quot; works.<br /> <br /> If you have Flashy stuff I&quot;m a Fairy/Space alien/Mutant... Its not like Vampires know shit about anything that's not vampires.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have cleave and Trail because I started out Avenger... I regret that choice now, but the powers are still cool at least. My trail can be detected and well... cleave is just cleave. I also took the trigger where I shout the names of my moves. The ghoul idea is interesting, but I also haven't told her what I am and she is the most suspicious because she's the one that accidentally almost killed me in a frenzy. I like the idea for others though. Could come in handy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23892-damienls","name":"DamienLS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23892_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T15:33:37-07:00","id":1200611,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DamienLS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200533#post1200533\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have cleave and Trail because I started out Avenger... I regret that choice now, but the powers are still cool at least. My trail can be detected and well... cleave is just cleave. I also took the trigger where I shout the names of my moves. The ghoul idea is interesting, but I also haven't told her what I am and she is the most suspicious because she's the one that accidentally almost killed me in a frenzy. I like the idea for others though. Could come in handy.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You call out your attacks? serious go full on shonen logic, you were trained in some sort of secret martial art. I mean honestly even &quot;telling the truth&quot; would confuse her unless the game is heavily noncanon","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T16:48:24-07:00","id":1200635,"title":"","content":"Tell them your a sorceror. Sorcs are like mages but with more rules and more down to earth. Think John Constantine or Harry Dresden. They can do different spells and rituals but they can't make up their own magic on the fly and rewrite reality at a whim like an awakened mage can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23951-acwrig2","name":"acwrig2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-28T16:50:28-07:00","id":1200636,"title":"","content":"Also, you married a Cainite even though you're imbued with religious like fervor to kill them. Also this Torreador married you without knowing what you are? Was this a drunk weekend in Vegas sort of thing? I think as a hunter your character could always do the easier thing and stake her. Use the correct piece of wood in the right location this time. Problem solved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23951,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23951-acwrig2","user":"acwrig2","date":". 03-28-2018, 08:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23951-acwrig2","name":"acwrig2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T01:28:32-07:00","id":1200736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>acwrig2</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200635#post1200635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tell them your a sorceror. Sorcs are like mages but with more rules and more down to earth. Think John Constantine or Harry Dresden. They can do different spells and rituals but they can't make up their own magic on the fly and rewrite reality at a whim like an awakened mage can.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not quite the down to earth folks actually. Many Sorcerers (or Hedge Magicians, in game talk) are even more fanatic about their art than the Awakened. Also, there's still the catch I described earlier.<br /> <br /> The ghoul thing would have worked, if the toreador wife knew about it. The whole &quot;shout the name of my attack&quot;-thing is nice, but even with access to Hunter.net most Edges would have very different names in every corner of the world, because all the names in the source books are game terms, for the players to use not for the characters.<br /> In the World of Darkness, there are many different powers. Numina, Hedge Magic and True Faith are those even &quot;normal&quot; humans can manifest. They are still extremely rare and not commonly known, so it is difficult to pass up as someone like that.<br /> The most easy solution would be to tell the vampires you're some kind of wizard and make up a story about how you discovered your arts. Maybe tell them your powers aren't quite as good as they think and you're a pretty solid fighter even without them. So this way, they might let it slip if you're smart about it. The whole &quot;shout your attack&quot;-move could be passed of as the &quot;invocation&quot; of that magic (which is actually kind of true at this point).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13221-thevarulfen","name":"TheVarulfen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T06:39:02-07:00","id":1200783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>acwrig2</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200636#post1200636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, you married a Cainite even though you're imbued with religious like fervor to kill them. Also this Torreador married you without knowing what you are? Was this a drunk weekend in Vegas sort of thing? I think as a hunter your character could always do the easier thing and stake her. Use the correct piece of wood in the right location this time. Problem solved.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, she was my wife before my imbuement, she frenzied and injured me, bam! If I murder her though I lose my wealthy spouse and Love merits... that'd be stupid. It's a complex situation to explain in full detail but there are reasons it happened how it did. Plus as of of now I am the ONLY hunter in the party of vampires now at least for the time being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23892-damienls","name":"DamienLS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23892_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T06:42:33-07:00","id":1200785,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheVarulfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200736#post1200736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Not quite the down to earth folks actually. Many Sorcerers (or Hedge Magicians, in game talk) are even more fanatic about their art than the Awakened. Also, there's still the catch I described earlier.<br /> <br /> The ghoul thing would have worked, if the toreador wife knew about it. The whole &quot;shout the name of my attack&quot;-thing is nice, but even with access to Hunter.net most Edges would have very different names in every corner of the world, because all the names in the source books are game terms, for the players to use not for the characters.<br /> In the World of Darkness, there are many different powers. Numina, Hedge Magic and True Faith are those even &quot;normal&quot; humans can manifest. They are still extremely rare and not commonly known, so it is difficult to pass up as someone like that.<br /> The most easy solution would be to tell the vampires you're some kind of wizard and make up a story about how you discovered your arts. Maybe tell them your powers aren't quite as good as they think and you're a pretty solid fighter even without them. So this way, they might let it slip if you're smart about it. The whole &quot;shout your attack&quot;-move could be passed of as the &quot;invocation&quot; of that magic (which is actually kind of true at this point).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, last night I told her I seem to be some variety of sorcerer, but that I'm uncertain exactly the nature of my powers to give me a little cover up. She gave me permission to act as a ghoul so long as I keep the masquerade. Now my party mostly thinks I'm her ghoul and I killed my target too. All is well that end in vampire crisps. Thanks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23892-damienls","name":"DamienLS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23892_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T09:22:42-07:00","id":1200837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DamienLS</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200785#post1200785\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, last night I told her I seem to be some variety of sorcerer, but that I'm uncertain exactly the nature of my powers to give me a little cover up. She gave me permission to act as a ghoul so long as I keep the masquerade. Now my party mostly thinks I'm her ghoul and I killed my target too. All is well that end in vampire crisps. Thanks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds like you have made a deal with the devil... <br /> <br /> But hey, a hunter figuratively <i>and</i> literally getting in bed with a blood-addled succubus is the bread and butter of the WoD. Let us know how it all works out!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-29T12:28:27-07:00","id":1200930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheVarulfen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1200468-how-do-you-cover-up-being-known-as-a-hunter-by-other-supernaturals?p=1200736#post1200736\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Not quite the down to earth folks actually. Many Sorcerers (or Hedge Magicians, in game talk) are even more fanatic about their art than the Awakened. Also, there's still the catch I described earlier.<br /> <br /> The ghoul thing would have worked, if the toreador wife knew about it. The whole &quot;shout the name of my attack&quot;-thing is nice, but even with access to Hunter.net most Edges would have very different names in every corner of the world, because all the names in the source books are game terms, for the players to use not for the characters.<br /> In the World of Darkness, there are many different powers. Numina, Hedge Magic and True Faith are those even &quot;normal&quot; humans can manifest. They are still extremely rare and not commonly known, so it is difficult to pass up as someone like that.<br /> The most easy solution would be to tell the vampires you're some kind of wizard and make up a story about how you discovered your arts. Maybe tell them your powers aren't quite as good as they think and you're a pretty solid fighter even without them. So this way, they might let it slip if you're smart about it. The whole &quot;shout your attack&quot;-move could be passed of as the &quot;invocation&quot; of that magic (which is actually kind of true at this point).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Not if you play them as an Orphan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23951-acwrig2","name":"acwrig2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}